  "releaseNotes": "Performance & Architecture Optimization\n      - Removed obsolete Finance Service.\n      - Simplified ManagerBase architecture.\n      - Refactored Log Manager and Simulation Manager for adaptive execution.\n      - Optimized Thread Manager and Worker permission handling.\n      - Increased API throughput from ~2–5K/sec to ~30–40K/sec.\n      - Fixed WebSocket client HTTP fallback before protocol upgrade.\n      - Reduced synchronization overhead and improved scalability.",
